  "notes": "Warm off-white (#faf8f4) page with no cards; content sits directly on background separated by hairline row rules and a thin vertical divider after the sidebar. Distinctive mix of a classic serif (Hoefler Text) for brand/title with small uppercase letter-spaced sans labels and monospace IDs. Links are plain blue (#2563eb) for order #, ID and customer email (emails truncated with ellipsis). Status pills are fully rounded: neutral outlined grey for PAID/UNFULFILLED, light green fill + green text for FULFILLED. Buttons are small outlined uppercase rectangles with 6px radius. Hidden 'Toggle admin sections' checkbox suggests the sidebar collapses on narrow screens. Export CSV acts on whole table. No row selection or bulk actions."
